{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"520646a91563ee72237fb26e1c101e88d6486c5798d4a2ce5daa2ea560f67547","ja":"想いを叫んで！","zh":"喊出心声！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8995ee67a62d9955e2e4da2ef0323bc1c00b043fd4a0b4c3d807eab032c00eba","ja":"茜ちゃんは～！　世界中のみ～んなが\n茜ちゃん人形を愛でるようになる日まで……。","zh":"小茜要～！　直到全世界的所有～人都\n开始宠爱小茜人偶的那一天……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3cd561421426ec933642e8cfd0c811ceb3968b3ddd83ee40db87a8aa0dda2b39","ja":"全力でアイドルするからね～！\nこれからも応援してね～☆","zh":"我会全力做好偶像的哦～！\n今后也要为我加油哦～☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d2e4642c0cc60aa14947ebbae1db4bd8693869f90bba48cd454e47321f7616fa","ja":"ワアァァァァァッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f8003c1b62f5f93a00d2a69405ef45a1f7ba3c2f762ee282dd8f61356d8379bd","ja":"ええと、アタシはなんて言っていいか\nまだ、まとまんないんだけど……みんなサイコーだね！","zh":"那个，我都不知道该怎么说\n虽然思绪还没整理好……但大家真的太棒了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1614970e2421453c9bcddc7296c3b9d4cefb22e38096705ba92e3fa99893e19a","ja":"みんなの叫びで、いっぱい勇気\nもらったよ～！　アタシも頑張る～！","zh":"听到大家的呐喊，我得到了好多\n勇气哦～！　我也要加油～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d2e4642c0cc60aa14947ebbae1db4bd8693869f90bba48cd454e47321f7616fa","ja":"ワアァァァァァッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"0a800a2fcc756d216124260beee1af8adbd716e46babfaa541d85cd78310c60d","ja":"私は……最近気づいたことを、\nみんなに伝えたいと思いますっ！","zh":"我想……把自己最近察觉到的事，\n传达给大家！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4a9cc630a38121400f3ad8eecc5471c544e09fbb9e54881346f7fa1bfb5634b0","ja":"私、アイドルも学校も、全力で頑張ろうって\n思って、今までいろいろやってきたんですけど……。","zh":"我一直想着无论是做偶像还是上学，\n都要全力以赴，至今也做了各种各样的努力……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"925acd1cc2d970c0e5bcee9612eb457860754ceefc1b9a88c9dc081a0c584591","ja":"いつの間にか、視野が狭くなっていたみたいで。\nこの前、友達に言われたんです。頼ってほしいって！","zh":"不知不觉间，我的眼界好像变窄了。\n前阵子朋友跟我说，希望我能依靠她们！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1627ae93691dbd00f45a7ff58946e9c79061eaa88fbe6a83885bcf8f6f9f1874","ja":"私、その言葉がすごく嬉しくて！　だから……。","zh":"听到那句话我真的非常开心！所以……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"85564c73039c7fb61a332624d2a6f9fb25f25d0a8caaf0f75897a043d5f7628b","ja":"みんなも忘れないでください！\n助けてくれる、誰かのことを～！","zh":"大家也请不要忘记！\n那些向你伸出援手的人～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4344bf505da9a80c1d082c9a9acaebde195f7f9707257b861b1160fbbd273b86","ja":"「紗代子ちゃーん！　伝えてくれてありがとー！」\n「紗代子ちゃんの言葉……忘れないよ～！」","zh":"「纱代子——！谢谢你传达给我们——！」\n「纱代子的话……我们不会忘记的～！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"214bd1f5625f1dfc7e1c3a16c54df81f154442e739a731237c2d7b4341b8e693","ja":"みんな、ありがと～！","zh":"谢谢大家～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"54b1f65bad6f80b17678cfbbcd97bb76045e8a9c03f21c3daf6a31e215934489","ja":"やっぱ、友達っていいよね！\n紗代子も紗代子の学校の友達も、ほんとサイコー！","zh":"果然有朋友真好啊！\n不管是纱代子还是纱代子学校的朋友，都超级棒！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1677.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6999718f1a1d36e4ed034c4c719ecfe703bcd905360b9b0b1bdff21d2c0815e6","ja":"うんうん！　さてさて、茜ちゃんたちも想いを叫べたし\n収録はここまで！　それじゃあ、まったね～！","zh":"嗯嗯！好啦好啦，小茜她们也倾诉出了自己的心声，\n录制就到这里！那么，下次再见喽～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
